<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-005" chapter-id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng" source-id="s-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng">
  <p id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">征南將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account:m0004" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山簡</persName>、荊州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account:m0011" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">王澄</persName>、南中郎將<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account:m0018" ref="uuj_hen_12i">杜蕤</persName>並遣兵援京師，及<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account:m0028" ref="als_c6t_b83">如</persName>戰于宛，諸軍皆大敗；<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-wangcheng:account:m0039" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">王澄</persName>獨以衆進至沶口，衆潰而歸。</p>
</text>
